# Support project

Agent skill: [.cursor/skills/support-agent/SKILL.md](../skills/support-agent/SKILL.md)

## Scope

`support/frontend`, `support/backend`, `support/backend/migrations`.

## Ports and env

| Layer | Port | Env file |
|-------|------|----------|
| Frontend | 3021 | `support/frontend/.env` (`VITE_*` only) |
| Backend | 4021 | `support/backend/.env` |

Backend loads only `support/backend/.env`. Production host: `https://support.webonone.com`.

## Ownership

- Public how-tos for WebOnOne users. No login.
- Articles in `frontend/src/content/en/**/*.md` and `frontend/src/content/si/**/*.md` (Sinhala mirrors English paths; missing `si` file falls back to English).
- Health API + SPA fallback only. Help content is not stored in MySQL.

## Verification

```bash
npm run type-check -w support-root
```

IIS: [iis-deployment.mdc](iis-deployment.mdc) · [support/deploy/IIS.md](../../support/deploy/IIS.md)

All interactive UI must use `@webonone/ui-kit`.
